  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, we know that the projection of a vector&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the&nbsp;magnitude of projection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>169</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
